flowchart TB
    subgraph Client Tier
        Browser[Security Engineer Workstation / Web Browser]
    end

    subgraph Pentesa Host Boundary [Docker Compose Environment]
        subgraph Ingress & Presentation
            Nginx["Nginx Reverse Proxy & TLS\n(Port 443 / 80)"]
            FastAPI["FastAPI Backend & WebSocket Server\n(Port 8000)"]
        end

        subgraph Asynchronous Task & Queue Tier
            RedisQueue[("Redis 7 Task Broker & State Store")]
            CeleryWorker["Celery Execution Workers"]
            CeleryBeat["Celery Periodic Beat Scheduler"]
        end

        subgraph AI Agent & Reasoning Subsystem
            LangGraph["LangGraph Supervisor Orchestrator"]
            AgentPool["15 Specialized AI Security Agents"]
            LocalOllama["Local Ollama AI Inference Engine\n(Llama 3.1 / Qwen 2.5)"]
        end

        subgraph Deterministic Tool Sandbox
            NucleiWrap["Nuclei Scanner Wrapper"]
            KatanaWrap["Katana Crawler Wrapper"]
            FfufWrap["Ffuf Fuzzer Wrapper"]
            HttpxWrap["Httpx Prober Wrapper"]
            PythonChecks["Custom Python Security Checks"]
        end

        subgraph Scope & Egress Security
            EgressProxy["Scope-Enforcing Egress Proxy\n(DNS Pinning & Socket Filtering: Port 8080)"]
        end

        subgraph Data Tier
            Postgres[("PostgreSQL 16 Relational Datastore\n(pgcrypto Encrypted Tables)")]
            EvidenceStorage[("Local Forensic Evidence Storage\n(/var/pentesa/evidence)")]
            ReportStorage[("Local PTES Report Storage\n(/var/pentesa/reports)")]
        end
    end

    subgraph Target Infrastructure
        TargetWeb["Authorized Target Web Applications & APIs"]
    end

    Browser <-->|HTTPS 443 / WSS| Nginx
    Nginx <-->|HTTP / WS| FastAPI
    FastAPI <-->|SQLAlchemy ORM| Postgres
    FastAPI <-->|Enqueue Tasks| RedisQueue
    
    RedisQueue <--> CeleryWorker
    RedisQueue <--> CeleryBeat
    CeleryWorker <--> Postgres
    CeleryWorker <--> LangGraph
    
    LangGraph <--> AgentPool
    AgentPool <--> LocalOllama
    AgentPool --> NucleiWrap & KatanaWrap & FfufWrap & HttpxWrap & PythonChecks
    
    NucleiWrap & KatanaWrap & FfufWrap & HttpxWrap & PythonChecks -->|HTTP_PROXY| EgressProxy
    EgressProxy -->|Validated Scope Only| TargetWeb
    
    CeleryWorker --> EvidenceStorage
    CeleryWorker --> ReportStorage
